December, October, and April are candidates for further investigation because the dataset contains the most orders during these months (24,004, 19,436, and 17,528, respectively). Tuesdays accounted for 26,063 orders, while Fridays had the lowest order count. Activity was highest between 11:00–13:00 and 18:00–20:00. These patterns describe order volume; advertising profitability cannot be determined without campaign and margin data.
